32
00:14:04,456 --> 00:14:33,363
It also in the front along Mystic Avenue had a pizza hut and a Dunkin Donuts as subtenants. Staples relocated to assembly at one point and the building was vacant. And then there was some structural issues there because the soil is very soft. The building is built on timber piles and those piles began to experience some disintegration due to fluctuation in the groundwater up and down

33
00:14:33,920 --> 00:15:02,945
which allowed the tops of the piles to begin disintegrating. So there's a point at which really the building couldn't be saved. And we did have to take the building down, I'll say three or four years ago. If you drive by today, you'll see there are cars parked there. It's being used on a temporary basis by one of the local car dealerships. And then in the middle here is Winterbrook. So that's the green strip in the middle. If you've walked by Winterbrook, it's not all that attractive. It continues.

34
