00:30:02,804 --> 00:30:32,217
The zone directly to our east is what's called recreational open space. It's the park here, park and pass that have been developed throughout the years along the Mystic. And we have a residential area here, a general residential area here. This black dash line around the property is 500 feet from our property line.

