00:30:32,521 --> 00:30:58,795
and that's one of the requirements is that we notify everyone within 500 feet of the property line that this meeting is happening and further meetings are happening. It also gives you an idea of what is next to the project. Our four buildings, as Chris had mentioned, I will go through them quickly here, 278 Mystic Avenue for those that

68
00:30:58,981 --> 00:31:08,667
attended the in-person event on Monday night. That's where the meeting was held. The old Staples building here in parking lot.

69
