00:35:13,608 --> 00:35:40,962
Um, we're all proposing to be a little more restrictive than as originally here. Uh, we are proposing, uh, that open spaces, uh, at a minimum are, uh, 30% of the, of the landscaped 30% and that open space, um, according to the city's definition, um, is 25%. So that's basically usable space that you can occupy. Um, where, um,

79
00:35:42,160 --> 00:36:11,776
